message: >-
  Please cite TUN Systemic Design using this metadata when using the framework,
  documentation, or reference implementation. Include the exact repository
  commit, document or package scope, and access date; see GOVERNANCE.md.
type: software
title: "TUN Systemic Design"
authors:
  - family-names: "Tun"
    given-names: "Christopher"
    website: "https://github.com/kochrisdev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kochrisdev/TUN-Systemic-Design"
url: "https://github.com/kochrisdev/TUN-Systemic-Design"
abstract: >-
  A design framework and reference implementation for human-AI products.
  TUN connects explicit intent, visible context, version-bound approval,
  application-owned authorization, execution, verification, and recovery
  through behavioral guidance, React components, requirement traceability,
  and a runnable local host-integration example.
keywords:
  - design systems
  - human-AI interaction
  - agent interfaces
  - approval workflows
  - verification
  - conformance
